   "text": "Raspberry Pi Pico (RP2040)\n\nCore 0: network, SNMP, web page,\nLLDP, NTP, syslog, menu,\ntemperatures, load, watchdog\n8 s (fed while core 1 runs)\n\nCore 1: GPIO27 + GPIO22, 1 kHz",
